SUMMARY:SALSATECA FIESTA!
DESCRIPTION:Your Salsa\, Bachata and Cuban Party in Lewisham\nOn the last Saturday of Every Month\nLearn Salsa\, learn Bachata! Have fun and meet new friends!​ \nOur regular Saturdays become a party on the last Saturday of every month. Experience an unforgettable Salsa & Bachata Party at the Zhulin Hidden Village in Lewisham. \nWe kick off the night with Salsa & Bachata lessons. If you’re new to dancing\, we recommend joining our beginners’ group. All levels are welcome! No prior experience or dance partner is needed. Many attendees come solo\, and we rotate partners throughout the lesson\, giving you the chance to dance with different people. If you’d prefer to stay with your own partner for the entire class\, just let the teacher know\, and we’ll be happy to accommodate you. \nSince most Latin parties feature both Salsa and Bachata\, learning both is not only fun but also a must! \nSo\, we strongly recommend and encourage our students to learn both. \nSCHEDULE: \n7pm to 8pm: \nSALSA (Cross Body Style) \nBeginners (Teacher: TBC) \nImprovers (Teacher: TBC) \nIntermediate/Adv (Teacher: TBC) \n8pm to 9pm: \nBACHATA \nBeginners (Teacher: TBC) \nImprovers (Teacher: TBC) \nIntermediate/Adv (Teacher: TBC) \n9pm to 1am: \nParty Time with Dj TBC \n​Level info \n100-104 Lewisham High St\, London SE13 5JH\nLewisham (Only 8 min train from London Bridge) \nIf you’re looking for a Salsa club in London\, you’re in the right place. After the lessons\, we party until 1am. You can practice your moves\, meet new people\, and dive into the rhythm of Latin dance.
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/salsateca-fiesta-2-2/2026-06-27/
LOCATION:WCKUK Lewisham\, Zhulin Hidden Village\, 100-104 Lewisham High Street\, London\, United Kingdom
CATEGORIES:London
END:VEVENT
